  "Specification": "Chameneos: A concurrency puzzle where M color-changing creatures (chameneos) meet pairwise at a meeting place up to N times. Each meeting causes both creatures to adopt the complement color; a creature arriving when meetings are exhausted fades. Tracks numMeetings and per-chameneos meeting counts. Property SumMet: when all N meetings are done, the total individual meeting counts equal 2*N.",
